{"script":"Main_0_05_6","des":"装备强化的方法","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"charaName":"见习铁匠达特","text":"[show]嗯……这样，这样，然后再这样……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"见习铁匠达特","text":"[show]先搭个简单的熔炉……然后是中央工房淘汰掉的廉价铁砧，给你放在这儿。[r]哈！这硬度连我奶奶的鞋底都比不上，一撅就烂。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"见习铁匠达特","text":"[show]好，成了。你把这些东西搬到你想搬的位置上吧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":0,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-331.5,"scaleX":1.5,"y":-187.5,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":0.4,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-331.5,"scaleX":1.5,"y":-187.5,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"bright":0.6,"alpha":0,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara1","x":67,"scaleX":1,"y":-215,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara001_0","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"bright":0.6,"alpha":1,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara1","x":67,"scaleX":1,"y":-215,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara001_0","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":0,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":700,"scaleX":0.9,"y":-264.80000000000007,"scaleY":0.9,"img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":1,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":700,"scaleX":0.9,"y":-264.80000000000007,"scaleY":0.9,"img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]这算是……铁匠铺吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"bright":0.6,"alpha":1,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":700,"scaleX":0.9,"y":-264.80000000000007,"scaleY":0.9,"img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"见习铁匠达特","text":"[show]哈？铁匠铺？那可是我们吃饭的家伙。这就是个最简单的锻造台。[r]这种炉子升起来的温度，能烧烂那些破铜烂铁就已经谢天谢地了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"见习铁匠达特","text":"[show]……你也不要嫌弃它。自从兽潮毁了中央工房，我们手边就只有这种东西了。[r]茜塔让我给你们最好的，这就是了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"见习铁匠达特","text":"[show]快把锻造台搭上。有了它，就可以把破旧的护甲片和废旧的装备重新熔炼，[r]强化你们现有的装备了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":1,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara1","x":67,"scaleX":1,"y":-215,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara001_0","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"希尔","text":"[show]呃……好的。谢谢你，达特先生。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}